id=live_gpu_driver
name=Live GPU Driver Mount (late-root friendly)
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=live_gpu_driver
description=Runtime GPU driver replacement via bind mounts into init/zygote or per-app mount namespaces. No OverlayFS needed — works with LATE-LOADED KernelSU. Driver zips (AdrenoToolsDrivers format) loaded from /sdcard/Download via the WebUI. After reboot: WebUI or Action button to re-apply.
